      "date": "2026-07-27 21:18:45.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nExperimental feature testing in progress, please pay attention to the comments\n\nLooks good. The version boundary and the 32b/32c subtest set both check out: 74a5b9efaa is the commit that added both the fscrypt content in disk2_15-*.tar.bz2 and the t32_test unlock/filter handling, and 32b/32c are the only pre-74a5b9efaa subtests that pass \"writeconf\" to t32_test() with the 2_15 image (32a/32d skip the sha1sum and list verification entirely, 32e/32f/32g are restricted to the 2_9/2_10/2_12 images, and 32h-32j did not exist before that commit). One ordering nit inline.",
